🚀 SageMaker JumpStart

JumpStart is a feature in AWS SageMaker that helps you start Machine Learning and AI projects quickly.

=====

JumpStart → Train your own model with pretrained LLM models

Simple explanation

Instead of creating and training a model completely from the beginning:

Build Model from Scratch
        ↓
Needs more time and data

===

With JumpStart:

Pretrained Model
       ↓
Add Your Own Data
       ↓
Fine-tune / Train
       ↓
Your Custom AI Model
       ↓
Deploy

====

Example

Suppose you want to create an AI chatbot for a real estate company.

Pretrained LLM
       +
Real Estate Data
       ↓
Fine-tuning / Customization
       ↓
Real Estate AI Chatbot

====

SageMaker JumpStart = Start with a pretrained model and customize it for your own use case.

SageMaker JumpStart reduces development time by starting with a pretrained model, while 
fine-tuning adapts that model to your own data and task for a more specialized result.

===
